#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:400
#, no-c-format
msgid "You can only make changes if you run this module with superuser rights."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:403
#, no-c-format
msgid "General"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:405
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"First you have a drop down box to choose the language for your login box, "
"corresponding to setting <option>Language</option> in &kdmrc;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:409
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In the <guilabel>Appearance</guilabel> section you have an option to use "
"&kdm; in themed mode. If <guilabel>Use themed greeter</guilabel> is checked, "
"the settings on the <guilabel>Dialog</guilabel> and <guilabel>Background</"
"guilabel> pages cannot be configured separately."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:414
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"While &kde;'s style depends on the settings of the user logged in, the style "
"used by &kdm; can be configured using the <guilabel>GUI style:</guilabel> "
"and <guilabel>Color scheme:</guilabel> options. These correspond to the keys "
"<link linkend=\"option-guistyle\"><option>GUIStyle</option></link> and <link "
"linkend=\"option-colorscheme\"><option>ColorScheme</option></link> in "
"&kdmrc; respectively."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:422
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"From the <guilabel>Fonts</guilabel> section of this page you can change the "
"fonts used in the login window. Only fonts available to all users are "
"available here, not fonts you have installed on a per user basis."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:426
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can select three different font styles from the drop down box "
#| "(<guilabel>Greeting</guilabel>, <guilabel>Fail</guilabel>, "
#| "<guilabel>Standard</guilabel>). When you click on the <guibutton>Change "
#| "font</guibutton> button a dialog appears from which you can select the "
#| "new characteristics for the font style."
msgid ""
"You can select three different font styles in this section "
"(<guilabel>General:</guilabel>, <guilabel>Failure:</guilabel>, "
"<guilabel>Greeting:</guilabel>). When you click on the <guibutton>Choose...</"
"guibutton> button a dialog appears from which you can select the new "
"characteristics for the font style."
msgstr ""
"អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​រចនាប័ទ្ម​ពុម្ព​អក្សរ​ផ្សេង​គ្នា​បី​ពី​ប្រអប់​ទម្លាក់​ចុះ (<guilabel>វន្ទនាការ</guilabel> "
"<guilabel>បរាជ័យ</guilabel> <guilabel>​ទូទៅ</guilabel>) ។ ពេល​អ្នក​ចុច​លើ​ប៊ូតុង "
"<guibutton>ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​ពុម្ព​អក្សរ</guibutton> ប្រអប់​មួយ​លេចឡើង​ចេញ​ពី​អ្វី​ដែល​អ្នក​បាន​ជ្រើស​​លក្ខណៈ​ថ្មី​"
"សម្រាប់​ពុម្ព​អក្សរ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:434
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guilabel>Standard</guilabel> font is used in all other places in the "
#| "login window."
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>General:</guilabel> font is used in all other places in the "
"login window."
msgstr "ពុម្ព​អក្សរ <guilabel>ទូទៅ</guilabel> ត្រូវ​បាន​ប្រើ​នៅ​គ្រប់​កន្លែង​ក្នុង​បង្អួច​ចូល ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:438
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "The <guilabel>Fail</guilabel> font is used when a login fails."
msgid "The <guilabel>Failure:</guilabel> font is used when a login fails."
msgstr "ពុម្ព​អក្សរ <guilabel>បរាជ័យ</guilabel> ត្រូវ​បាន​ប្រើ​ពេល​ការ​ចូល​បាន​បរាជ័យ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:442
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The <guilabel>Greeting</guilabel> font is the font used for the title "
#| "(Greeting String)."
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Greeting:</guilabel> font is the font used for the title "
"(Greeting String)."
msgstr ""
"ពុម្ព​អក្សរ <guilabel>វន្ទនាការ</guilabel> គឺ​ជា​ពុម្ព​អក្សរ​ដែល​ត្រូវ​បាន​ប្រើ​សម្រាប់​ចំណង​ជើង (ខ្សែ​"
"អក្សរ​ស្វាគមន៍) ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:447
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You can also check the box labeled <guilabel>Use anti-aliasing for fonts</"
"guilabel> if you want smoothed fonts in the login dialog."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:453
#, no-c-format
msgid "Dialog"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:455
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "From this page you can change the visual appearance of &kdm;, &kde;'s "
#| "graphical login manager."
msgid ""
"From this page you can change the visual appearance of &kdm;, &kde;'s "
"graphical login manager in non themed mode."
msgstr ""
"នៅ​​ទំព័រ​នេះ អ្នក​អាច​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​រូបរាង​​របស់ KDM ដែល​ជា​កម្មវិធី​គ្រប់គ្រង​ការ​ចូល​ក្រាហ្វិក​របស់ KDE ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:458
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The <guilabel>Greeting:</guilabel> is the title of the login screen. Setting "
"this is especially useful if you have many servers users may log in to. You "
"may use various placeholders, which are described along with the "
"corresponding key <link linkend=\"option-greetstring\"><option>GreetString</"
"option></link> in &kdmrc;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:466
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "You can then choose to show either the current system time, a logo or "
#| "nothing special in the login box. Make your choice in the radio buttons "
#| "labeled <guilabel>Logo area</guilabel>. Using the <guilabel>Positions</"
#| "guilabel> setting, you can choose to either center the content of the "
#| "logo area or to position it using fixed coordinates."
msgid ""
"You can then choose to show either the current system time, a logo or "
"nothing special in the login box. Make your choice in the radio buttons "
"labeled <guilabel>Logo area:</guilabel>. This corresponds to <link linkend="
"\"option-logoarea\"><option>LogoArea</option></link> in &kdmrc;"
msgstr ""
"នៅពេល​នោះ​អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​ឲ្យ​បង្ហាញ​​ពេល​វេលា​ប្រព័ន្ធ​បច្ចុប្បន្ន ឡូហ្គោ ឬ​គ្មាន​អ្វី​ពិសេស​នៅក្នុង​ប្រអប់​ចូល ។ "
"ជ្រើស​ជម្រើស​របស់​អ្នក​នៅ​ក្នុង​ប៊ូតុង​មូល​ដែល​មាន​ស្លាក<guilabel>តំបន់​ឡូហ្គោ</guilabel> ។ ដោយ​ប្រើ​ការ​"
"កំណត់ <guilabel>ទីតាំង</guilabel> អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​​ដាក់​មាតិកា​នៅ​កណ្ដាល​តំបន់​ឡូហ្គោ ឬ​ដាក់​ទីតាំង​វា​ដោយ​"
"ប្រើ​កូអរដោណេ​ថេរ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:471
#, no-c-format
msgid "If you chose <guilabel>Show logo</guilabel> you can now choose a logo:"
msgstr "ប្រសិន​បើ​អ្នក​ជ្រើស <guilabel>បង្ហាញ​ឡូហ្គោ</guilabel> អ្នក​អាច​ជ្រើស​ឡូហ្គោ​បាន ៖"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:476
#, no-c-format
msgid "Drop an image file on the image button."
msgstr "ទម្លាក់​ឯកសារ​រូបភាព​មួយ​លើ​ប៊ូតុង​រូបភាព ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:479
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Click on the image button and select a new image from the image chooser "
"dialog."
msgstr "ចុច​លើ​ប៊ូតុង​រូបភាព ហើយ​​ជ្រើស​រូបភាព​ថ្មី​ពី​ប្រអប់​​ជ្រើស​រូបភាព ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:484
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "If you do not specify a logo the default <filename>$<envar>KDEDIR</envar>/"
#| "share/apps/kdm/pics/kdelogo.png</filename> will be displayed."
msgid ""
"If you do not specify a logo, the default <filename>$<envar>KDEDIR</envar>/"
"share/apps/kdm/pics/kdelogo.xpm</filename> will be displayed."
msgstr ""
"ប្រសិន​បើ​អ្នក​មិន​បញ្ជាក់​ឡូហ្គោទេ លំនាំ​ដើម <filename>$<envar>KDEDIR</envar>/share/apps/"
"kdm/pics/kdelogo.png</filename> នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​បង្ហាញ ។"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:488
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Normally the login box is centered on the screen. Drag the anchor to move "
"the center of the dialog to the desired position. Keyboard control is "
"possible as well: Use the arrow keys or <keycap>Home</keycap> to center. "
"Note that the actual proportions of the dialog are probably different. These "
"correspond to the key <link linkend=\"option-greeterpos"
"\"><option>GreeterPos</option></link> in &kdmrc;."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:499
#, no-c-format
msgid "<title>Background</title>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:501
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Here you can change the desktop background which will be displayed before a "
"user logs in. Selecting <guilabel>Enable background</guilabel> allows you to "
"edit the options on this tab."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:505
#, no-c-format
msgid "This tab is comprised of three areas:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:509
#, no-c-format
msgid "An area for selecting background images"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:512
#, no-c-format
msgid "The background Preview Monitor"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:515
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "No image is displayed. Just the background colors."
msgid "An area for determining the background color"
msgstr "គ្មាន​រូបភាព​ដែល​ត្រូវ​បង្ហាញ ។ គឺ​មាន​តែ​ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាងក្រោយ ។"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:521
#, no-c-format
msgid "Preview Monitor"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:523
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This is a preview window. It will give you a sense of what to expect with "
"each change."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:529
#, no-c-format
msgid "<guilabel>Background</guilabel>"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:531
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This section allows you to load a wallpaper on top of the color gradient "
"chosen in the section below."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:534
#, no-c-format
msgid "There are three choices available here:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:538
#, no-c-format
msgid "No Picture"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:540
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"No picture background will be shown. The color and pattern choices below "
"will still take effect."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:546
#, no-c-format
msgid "Picture"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:548
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"A single picture will be used as the background for the selected desktops."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:550
#, no-c-format
msgid "How this picture is positioned and scaled can be fine tuned below."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:556
#, no-c-format
msgid "Slide show"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:558
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kde; allows you to have an automatic slide show of wallpaper images. To "
"enable this option, press the <guibutton>Setup...</guibutton> button. In the "
"resulting dialog you may choose any image or folder of images available on "
"your computer, using the <guibutton>Add...</guibutton> button to navigate "
"your file system. <guibutton>Remove</guibutton> will remove the currently "
"selected entry from the list."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:566
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"You may choose the length of time any image is displayed in the "
"<guilabel>Change picture after:</guilabel> box, and you may choose "
"<guibutton>Show pictures in random order</guibutton> if you don't want them "
"displayed in the order they are listed."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:571
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Displaying wallpaper requires that the image be kept in memory. If you are "
"low on memory, using a small, tiled image or none at all is recommended."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:575
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Scaling or centering a small image still requires an image the size of your "
"display to be maintained in memory."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:584
#, no-c-format
msgid "Options"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:588
#, no-c-format
msgid "Position:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:590
#, no-c-format
msgid "Centered"
msgstr "កណ្ដាល"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:591
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The image will be centered on the screen. The background colors will be "
#| "present anywhere the image does not cover."
msgid ""
"The image will be centered on the screen without changing the size of the "
"image. The background colors will be present anywhere the image does not "
"cover."
msgstr ""
"រូបភាព​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​ដាក់​នៅ​កណ្ដាល​អេក្រង់ ។ ពណ៌​ផ្ទៃ​ខាង​ក្រោយ​នឹង​ត្រូវបាន​ដាក់​នៅ​កន្លែង​ណា​ដែល​រូបភាព​មិន​គ្រប​"
"ដណ្ដប់ ។"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:596
#, no-c-format
msgid "Tiled"
msgstr "ក្បឿង"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:597
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The image will be duplicated until it fills the entire desktop. The first "
"image will be placed in the upper left corner of the screen, and duplicated "
"downward and to the right."
msgstr ""
"រូបភាព​នឹង​ត្រូវបាន​ស្ទួន​រហូត​ទាល់​តែ​វាពេញ​ផ្ទៃតុ​ទាំង​មូល ។ រូបភាព​ទី​មួយ​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​ដាក់​នៅលើ​ជ្រុង​ខាង​ឆ្វេង​នៃ​"
"អេក្រង់ ហើយ​រូបភាព​ដែល​បាន​ស្ទួន​​ដាក់​នៅ​ទៅ​ក្រោម​ និង​ទៅ​ខាង​ស្ដាំ ។"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:602
#, no-c-format
msgid "Center Tiled"
msgstr "កណ្ដាល ក្បឿង"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:603
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The image will be duplicated until it fills the entire desktop. The first "
"image will be placed in the center of the screen, and duplicated upward, "
"downward to the right, and to the left."
msgstr ""
"រូបភាព​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​ស្ទួន​រហូត​ទាល់​តែ​វា​ពេញ​ផ្ទៃ​តុ​ទាំង​មូល ។ រូបភាព​ទី​មួយ​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​ដាក់​នៅ​កណ្ដាល​អេក្រង់ ហើយ​"
"រូបភាព​ដែល​បាន​ស្ទួន​ត្រូវបាន​ដាក់​ទៅ​ខាង​លើ ទៅ​ក្រោម​ខាងស្ដាំ និង​ខាង​ឆ្វេង ។"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:608
#, no-c-format
msgid "Centered Maxpect"
msgstr "កណ្ដាល Maxpect"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:609
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The image will be placed in the center of the screen. It will be scaled to "
"fit the desktop, but it will not change the aspect ratio of the original "
"image. This will provide you with an image that is not distorted."
msgstr ""
"រូបភាព​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​ដាក់​នៅ​កណ្ដាល​អេក្រង់ ។ វា​នឹង​ត្រូវបាន​ធ្វើ​មាត្រដ្ឋាន​ឲ្យសម​ផ្ទៃតុ ប៉ុន្តែ​វា​​មិន​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​"
"សមាមាត្រ​ទិដ្ឋភាព​របស់​រូបភាព​ដើម​នោះ​ទេ ។ វា​នឹង​ផ្ដល់​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​នូវ​រូបភាព​ដែល​មិនបាន​បង្ខូច​ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ ។"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:615
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Centered Maxpect"
msgid "Tiled Maxpect"
msgstr "កណ្ដាល Maxpect"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:617
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The image will be placed in the center of the screen. It will be scaled "
#| "to fit the desktop, but it will not change the aspect ratio of the "
#| "original image. This will provide you with an image that is not distorted."
msgid ""
"The image will be placed in the corner of the screen. It will be scaled to "
"fit the desktop, but it will not change the aspect ratio of the original "
"image. This will provide you with an image that is not distorted. If there "
"is any space over, the image will be duplicated to fill it."
msgstr ""
"រូបភាព​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​ដាក់​នៅ​កណ្ដាល​អេក្រង់ ។ វា​នឹង​ត្រូវបាន​ធ្វើ​មាត្រដ្ឋាន​ឲ្យសម​ផ្ទៃតុ ប៉ុន្តែ​វា​​មិន​ផ្លាស់ប្ដូរ​"
"សមាមាត្រ​ទិដ្ឋភាព​របស់​រូបភាព​ដើម​នោះ​ទេ ។ វា​នឹង​ផ្ដល់​ឲ្យ​អ្នក​នូវ​រូបភាព​ដែល​មិនបាន​បង្ខូច​ទ្រង់ទ្រាយ ។"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:625
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scaled"
msgstr "មាត្រដ្ឋាន"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:626
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid ""
#| "The image will be scaled to fit the desktop. It will be stretched to fit "
#| "all four corners."
msgid ""
"The image will be scaled to fit the desktop. It will be stretched to fit to "
"all four corners. This may distort the image."
msgstr ""
"រូបភាព​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​ធ្វើ​មាត្រដ្ឋាន​ឲ្យ​សម​ផ្ទៃតុ ។ វា​នឹង​ត្រូវ​បាន​ទាញ​ឲ្យ​វែង​ដើម្បី​ដាក់​ឲ្យ​ពេញ​ជ្រុង​ទាំង​បួន ។"

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:630
#, fuzzy, no-c-format
#| msgid "Centered"
msgid "Centered Auto fit"
msgstr "កណ្ដាល"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:632
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If the picture fits the desktop size, this mode works like the centered "
"option. If the picture is larger than the desktop then it is scaled down to "
"fit while keeping the aspect ratio."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: term
#: index.docbook:639
#, no-c-format
msgid "Scale &amp; Crop"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:641
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Magnify the picture without distorting it until it fills both the width and "
"height of the desktop (cropping the picture if necessary), and then center "
"it on the desktop."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: guilabel
#: index.docbook:650
#, no-c-format
msgid "Colors:"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:652
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The first drop down box allows you to choose the type of color, gradient, or "
"pattern to display under (or in place of) wallpaper."
